      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEO DEVERE (1) missed the frame last time when fifth (30.01) at Sandown but prior to that had two placings in a row. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of five starts. Has ability and can bounce back. PAW MAUD (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Traralgon in a handy 32.97 beating Lakeview Ian. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Can make it back-to-back wins. DYNAMITE ERIC (8) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling off pace at this track, but prior to that won easily by 3 lengths at this track (27.49) beating Noah's Best in a Grade 5 on August 4. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CANYA TORNADO (2) can feature with the right run.",
